  "title": {
   "en": "I Want To Eat the Arm of a God-Tier Artist"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Kami eshi no ude ga tabetai"
   },
   {
    "ja": "神絵師の腕が食べたい"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Dave, a struggling artist, gets his hands on the severed arm of his best friend Lewis, known as a artistic prodigy. When Dave recalls a rumor that eating parts of an artist's body transfers their talent... The story of friendship and jealousy leads to an unexpected conclusion!",
   "ja": "売れない画家デイブは、神絵師と呼ばれる親友ルウィスのちぎれた腕を手に入れる。デイブは、絵師の体の一部を食べたらその技術を受け継げるという噂を思い出すのだが…。親友との絆と嫉妬に揺れる物語の結末は―――!?"
  },
